# Env files. `.env.*` covers the fleet's .env.staging/.env.prod convention —
# the stock list below only covered .env and *.local, so a staging deploy left
# real secrets untracked (TRIMM, 2026-08-21). The negation keeps the template.
.env.*
!.env.example

